---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import SortingVisualizer from '../../../components/algorithms/SortingVisualizer.vue';
---
<BaseLayout title="计数排序动画演示 - Demo Center" description="计数排序算法动画演示，非比较排序，计数与重建，Java 代码同步高亮">
  <article class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 py-10">
    <a href="/algorithms" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-slate-400 hover:text-accent-dark dark:hover:text-accent transition-colors mb-6">
      <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 19l-7-7m0 0l7-7m-7 7h18"/></svg>
      返回算法列表
    </a>
    <header class="mb-8">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
        <span class="text-3xl">🔢</span>
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-1">
            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium rounded-full bg-purple-100 dark:bg-purple-900/30 text-purple-700 dark:text-purple-300 border border-purple-200 dark:border-purple-800">排序</span>
            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium rounded-full bg-green-100 dark:bg-green-900/30 text-green-700 dark:text-green-300 border border-green-200 dark:border-green-800">稳定</span>
            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium rounded-full bg-green-100 dark:bg-green-900/30 text-green-700 dark:text-green-300 border border-green-200 dark:border-green-800">O(n+k)</span>
          </div>
          <h1 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">计数排序 (Counting Sort)</h1>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-slate-400 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed">
        非比较排序算法。统计每个值出现的次数，然后按值的大小顺序重建数组。时间复杂度 O(n+k)，当 k 不大时性能远超比较排序。
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-4">
        {['非比较排序', '计数统计', '稳定排序', '需要额外空间', '整数专用'].map(s => (
          <span class="px-3 py-1 text-xs rounded-full bg-gray-100 dark:bg-slate-800 text-gray-600 dark:text-slate-400 border border-gray-200 dark:border-slate-700">{s}</span>
        ))}
      </div>
    </header>
    <SortingVisualizer client:load algorithm="counting" initialArray={[4, 2, 2, 8, 3, 3, 1, 5, 6, 4]} />
    <section class="mt-12 space-y-6">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">算法详解</h2>
      <div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-slate-700 bg-white dark:bg-slate-900/40 space-y-3">
        <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">核心思想</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
          计数排序不比较元素大小，而是利用「值」作为索引。三步走：① 找最大值，确定计数数组大小；
          ② 遍历数组，统计每个值出现次数（count[value]++）；③ 按值从 0 到 max 顺序，根据计数重建有序数组。紫色柱子表示当前查找的最大值。
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-slate-700 bg-white dark:bg-slate-900/40 space-y-3">
        <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">复杂度分析</h3>
        <div class="overflow-x-auto">
          <table class="w-full text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-slate-400">
            <thead>
              <tr class="border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-slate-700">
                <th class="text-left py-2 pr-4 font-medium">场景</th>
                <th class="text-left py-2 pr-4 font-medium">时间复杂度</th>
                <th class="text-left py-2 font-medium">说明</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody class="divide-y divide-gray-100 dark:divide-slate-800">
              <tr><td class="py-2 pr-4">最优</td><td class="py-2 pr-4 font-mono text-green-600 dark:text-green-400">O(n+k)</td><td class="py-2 text-xs">k 为最大值，需遍历 n + k 次</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="py-2 pr-4">平均</td><td class="py-2 pr-4 font-mono text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400">O(n+k)</td><td class="py-2 text-xs">与输入分布无关</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="py-2 pr-4">最差</td><td class="py-2 pr-4 font-mono text-red-500 dark:text-red-400">O(n+k)</td><td class="py-2 text-xs">k 很大时退化为 O(k)，空间也大</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="py-2 pr-4">空间</td><td class="py-2 pr-4 font-mono text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400">O(k)</td><td class="py-2 text-xs">计数数组长度 = max + 1</td></tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
